// SPEC qa.md appendix section 1: "`Unsigned`, `Signed` (with constraints: `Unsigned(bits=N, max=.., min=..)`,
// `Signed(bits=N)`)"; docs 04-variables: "mut d:Signed(min=20, max=30) = nil // only values from 20 to 30".
